      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://wyanetil.com/About/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Wyanet was officially platted in 1854 and became an incorporated village three years later in 1857.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://wyanetil.com/About/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Settlers first called the area 'Center' in 1821 before it evolved into the village we know today.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
